  "notes": [
    "The reviewer reads the grader's last sent-back verdict again",
    "Engineers ask the AI reviewer about a change before publishing it",
    "Self-hosted Primer runs the collaboration stack",
    "A failed boot-time registry sync serves the registry on disk and retries",
    "Agents that publish to Primer can reply on its threads",
    "A failed bot-user read never fails a minted token",
    "Agents can publish again: the publish schema takes the requester's by",
    "Gh 2.105.0 in the host setup",
    "A chat is \"ended without a reply\" only a minute after its run ends",
    "The reviewer sees the task's PRs already merged into the base again",
    "Setup waits for Paperclip and the board to be healthy before the setup link",
    "A fleet-audit comment reaches any task of its company",
    "A 404 from the plugin's post route is retried, not a final refusal",
    "Idle sweep stops on drain, dropped outcomes tell the owner, all live previous kernels are waited for",
    "The reviewer reads the owner's source exceptions from each base again",
    "A transient failure never becomes a stale, held, failed or unknown write",
    "The reviewer reads the changed files and the PR's Evidence section again",
    "Key a blocked escalation on its blocked episode",
    "Notices and owner messages are kept until they are delivered",
    "Host setup changed (ops/setup.sh or ops/vm): an update runs apply only, so running the installer again may be needed (curl -fsSL https://get.aidenhq.ai | sh)."
  ],
  "release": "2026.11.20"
